                <mxCell id="legend_body" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=11;fontColor=#34495E;spacingLeft=5;" value="• &lt;b&gt;45-bit Word:&lt;/b&gt; type(3b) | src(5b) | dest(5b) | imm(12b) | target(10b) | args(10b)&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;μ-Decoder:&lt;/b&gt; Decodes type and args into 33 discrete control lines.&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;μFetch MUX Rules:&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;   - &lt;i&gt;mloadIR, mdecode, mmov, mmovi, madd:&lt;/i&gt; next μPC (μpc + 1)&#xa;   - &lt;i&gt;mswitch:&lt;/i&gt; output of Switch Unit (entry point for IR opcode)&#xa;   - &lt;i&gt;mb:&lt;/i&gt; branchTarget directly&#xa;   - &lt;i&gt;mbeq:&lt;/i&gt; branchTarget if isMBranch == 1, else next μPC&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;Comparison with Horizontal:&lt;/b&gt; Vertical requires smaller ROM (45b vs 65b) but needs dedicated combinational decode logic in the control path." vertex="1">
